"the corresponding Consent Category content. Note: for consent-gated snippets "
"to be blocked until the visitor agrees, the Privacy Consent Tools option "
"(Privacy & Consent tab) must be enabled. You can leave the Code field empty "
"to list a cookie for disclosure only, without injecting any script — useful "
"for third-party services you cannot control directly."
msgstr ""

