msgstr ""

#: includes/options/advanced.php:584
msgid ""
"\"Block until consent\" completely prevents the script from loading until "
"the user agrees. \"Consent-aware\" always loads the script but passes the "
"current consent state to it — only use this for scripts that natively "
"support consent signals."
