"Controls if the native page title for events calendar archive pages should "
"be displayed above or below the filter bar, or if it should be disabled."
msgstr "控制日历归档页面的原生页面标题是显示在过滤框上方或下方或禁用。"

#: includes/options/events_calendar.php:64
msgid "Use Category Colors In Archives"
msgstr "在归档中使用分类颜色"

#: includes/options/events_calendar.php:65
msgid ""
"Turn on to use the category colors in event archive views when available. "
"When off, the Avada default coloring will be used for all events."
