#: includes/options/performance.php:206
msgid "Optimize Offscreen Rendering"
msgstr ""

#: includes/options/performance.php:207
msgid ""
"When enabled, Containers that are below the fold are only rendered when the "
"visitor scrolls near them. This reduces the amount of work the browser does "
"during the initial load, which can make pages load faster and scroll more "
"smoothly — especially on content-heavy pages. Headers, footers, and the "
"first (few) above-the-fold Containers are automatically exempted so hero "
"content is unaffected. You can override the behaviour per Container in its "
"Extras tab."
msgstr ""

#: includes/options/performance.php:214
msgid "Above The Fold Container Count"
msgstr ""

#: includes/options/performance.php:215
msgid ""
"Number of Containers at the top of the page body that are treated as above-"
"the-fold and therefore kept out of the offscreen-rendering optimization. "
"Increase this if your pages typically start with more than one hero-style "
"Container. Lower it to 0 for page types that start straight into content "
"with no hero. Individual Containers can still override this default."
msgstr ""

#: includes/options/performance.php:234
msgid "Emojis Script"
msgstr "Emojis脚本"

#: includes/options/performance.php:235
msgid ""
"If you don't use emojis you can improve performance by removing WordPress' "
"emojis script."
msgstr ""
"如果您不使用表情符号，可以通过移除 WordPress 的表情符号脚本来提高性能。"

#: includes/options/performance.php:247
msgid "jQuery Migrate Script"
msgstr "jQuery Migrate 脚本"

#: includes/options/performance.php:248
msgid ""
"If you are not using any deprecated jQuery code, you can disable this script "
"to improve performance."
msgstr "如果您没有使用任何已弃用的 jQuery 代码，可以禁用此脚本以提高性能。"

#: includes/options/performance.php:260
msgid "Load jQuery In Footer"
msgstr "在页脚加载 jQuery"

#: includes/options/performance.php:261
msgid ""
"Set to 'on' to defer loading of jQuery to the footer of the page. This will "
"only take effect if no other jQuery dependent scripts are added to the head. "
"Turning this on can cause JS scripts to break, use with caution."
msgstr ""
"设置为“开启”以将 jQuery 的加载推迟到页面的页脚。这仅在没有其他依赖 jQuery 的"
"脚本添加到页头时才会生效。开启此选项可能会导致 JS 脚本中断，请谨慎使用。"

#: includes/options/performance.php:269
msgid "Load Stylesheets In Footer"
msgstr "在页脚加载样式表"

#: includes/options/performance.php:270
msgid ""
"Set to 'on' to defer loading of the stylesheets to the footer of the page. "
"This improves page load time by making the styles non-render-blocking. "
"Depending on the connection speed, a flash of unstyled content (FOUC) might "
"occur."
msgstr ""
"设置为“开启”以将样式表的加载推迟到页面的页脚。这通过使样式非渲染阻塞来提高页"
"面加载速度。视连接速度而定，可能会出现未样式内容闪烁 (FOUC)。"

#: includes/options/performance.php:279
msgid ""
"<strong>IMPORTANT NOTE:</strong> .htaccess doesn't exist or it is not "
"writable."
msgstr "<strong>重要提示：</strong> .htaccess 不存在或不可写。"

#: includes/options/performance.php:284
msgid "Enable Gzip Compression"
msgstr "启用 Gzip 压缩"

#: includes/options/performance.php:285
msgid ""
"Set to 'on' to add Gzip Compression rules to the .htaccess file. "
"<strong>IMPORTANT:</strong> This option works only on Apache web servers "
"with mod_gzip and mod_deflate enabled."
msgstr ""
"设置为“开启”以将 Gzip 压缩规则添加到 .htaccess 文件。<strong>重要：</strong> "
"此选项仅适用于启用了 mod_gzip 和 mod_deflate 的 Apache Web 服务器。"

#: includes/options/performance.php:293
msgid "Enable Video Facade"
msgstr "启用视频门面"

#: includes/options/performance.php:294
msgid ""
"Use video facade in order to load video player only when video is played. "
"<strong>IMPORTANT:</strong> This option is only applied to YouTube and Vimeo "
"elements."
msgstr ""
"使用视频门面以便仅在播放视频时加载视频播放器。<strong>重要：</strong> 此选项"
"仅适用于 YouTube 和 Vimeo 元素。"

#: includes/options/performance.php:306
msgid "Clear Object Cache "
msgstr "清除对象缓存"

#: includes/options/performance.php:307
msgid ""
"Set to 'on' to clear WP's object cache on post edit, post deletion, and "
"Avada Form Entries page view. This is useful, if your setup or hoster uses "
"persistent object caching, to make sure that queries update when you add or "
"remove posts."
msgstr ""
"设置为“开启”以在编辑文章、删除文章和查看 Avada 表单条目页面时清除 WP 的对象缓"
"存。如果您的设置或托管商使用持久对象缓存，这很有用，可以确保在您添加或删除文"
"章时查询能得到更新。"

#: includes/options/performance.php:315
msgid "Number Of Post Revisions"
msgstr ""

#: includes/options/performance.php:316
msgid ""
"Controls how many revisions WordPress keeps for each post or page. Set to "
"\"-1\" to use the WordPress default (unlimited), \"0\" to disable revisions "
"completely, or any higher number to keep only that many of the most recent "
"revisions. Limiting revisions keeps the database smaller and prevents the "
"post editor from running out of memory on content-heavy pages that have "
"built up a large revision history."
msgstr ""

#: includes/options/performance.php:335
msgid "SVG Media Upload"
msgstr "SVG 媒体上传"

#: includes/options/performance.php:336
msgid ""
"Enable upload of SVG files and improve performance through their smaller "
"image and logo file size."
msgstr "启用 SVG 文件上传，并通过其较小的图像和标志文件大小来提高性能。"

#. translators: "System Statuss" page link.
#: includes/options/performance.php:350
msgid ""
"Select a modern format to use when uploading new images to the media "
"library. If you choose AVIF but your server is not able to convert to this "
"format, it will automatically fall back to webP. You can also convert all "
"your existing images on the %s page."
msgstr ""
"选择上传新图像到媒体库时使用的现代格式。如果您选择 AVIF 但您的服务器无法转换"
"为此格式，它将自动回退到 WebP。您还可以在 %s 页面上转换所有现有图像。"

#: includes/options/performance.php:356
msgid "WebP"
msgstr "WebP"

#: includes/options/performance.php:357
msgid "AVIF"
msgstr "AVIF"

#: includes/options/performance.php:363
msgid "Keep Original Upload Images"
msgstr "保留原始上传图像"

#: includes/options/performance.php:364
msgid ""
"If enabled, not only the image with its original upload format will be kept, "
"but also the created thumbnails. This will increase the filesystem storage "
"use of your images."
msgstr ""
"如果启用，不仅会保留原始上传格式'的图像，还会保留创建的缩略图。这将增加您图像"
"的文件系统存储使用量。"

#: includes/options/performance.php:383
msgid "Display Image Format"
msgstr "显示图像格式"

#: includes/options/performance.php:384
msgid ""
"If set to \"original\", Avada will try to load the images in their original "
"upload format. If set to \"modern\", it will try to load the images in the "
"upload image format you set above."
msgstr ""
"如果设置为“原始”，Avada 将尝试以原始上传格式加载图像。如果设置为“现代”，它将"
"尝试以您在上方设置的上传图像格式加载图像。"

#: includes/options/performance.php:390
msgid "Original"
msgstr "原始"

#: includes/options/performance.php:408
msgid "WordPress Image Quality"
msgstr "WordPress 图像质量"

#. translators: "Regenerate Thumbnails" plugin link.
#: includes/options/performance.php:410
msgid ""
"Controls the quality of the generated image sizes for every uploaded image. "
"Ranges between 0 and 100 percent. Higher values lead to better image quality "
"but also higher file sizes. <strong>NOTE:</strong> After changing this "
"value, please install and run the %s plugin once."
msgstr ""
"控制每张上传图像生成的图像尺寸的质量。范围在 0 到 100%% 之间。较高的值会带来"
"更好的图像质量，但也会导致更大的文件大小。<strong>注意：</strong> 更改此值"
"后，请安装并运行一次 %s 插件。"

#: includes/options/performance.php:423
msgid "WordPress webP Image Quality"
msgstr "WordPress WebP 图像质量"

#. translators: "Regenerate Thumbnails" plugin link.
#: includes/options/performance.php:425
msgid ""
"Controls the quality of the generated image sizes for every uploaded webP "
"image. Ranges between 0 and 100 percent. Higher values lead to better image "
"quality but also higher file sizes. <strong>NOTE:</strong> After changing "
"this value, please install and run the %s plugin once."
msgstr ""
"控制每张上传的 WebP 图像生成的图像尺寸的质量。范围在 0 到 100%% 之间。较高的"
"值会带来更好的图像质量，但也会导致更大的文件大小。<strong>注意：</strong> 更"
"改此值后，请安装并运行一次 %s 插件。"

#: includes/options/performance.php:445
msgid "Avada Image Sizes"
msgstr "Avada 图像尺寸"

#: includes/options/performance.php:446
msgid ""
"Choose which Avada image sizes should be created for every image uploaded to "
"the Media Library. <strong>NOTE:</strong> Image sizes used in legacy areas/"
"features of Avada are marked with (L). When you remove image sizes here, "
"please check your site to make sure all layouts display correctly. After "
"changing this value, please install and run the %s plugin once."
msgstr ""
"选择应为上传到媒体库的每张图像创建哪些 Avada 图像尺寸。<strong>注意：</"
"strong> 在 Avada 旧版区域/功能中使用的图像尺寸标记为 (L)。在此处移除图像尺寸"
"时，请检查您的网站以确保所有布局显示正确。更改此值后，请安装并运行一次 %s 插"
"件。"

